          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.11+GEN.28.12+GEN.28.13+GEN.28.14+GEN.28.15+GEN.28.16+GEN.28.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Uum 28.11-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqi waan Yakobooni jed'e, Kai, Betheliti godaani, achi qubad'u. Achiti, Waaqa gaafa atini oboleesa kanke Esau baqatte siti mullate, fulla sorio iti qalani mid'aasiifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba Yakobooni waan worra isaatiifi nama isa woliini jiruuni jed'e, waaqoota harkaani boch'ani, ta lafa nyaapati kad'attani taani gata ufi qulqulleesa, woya jijirad'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koota, Betheli godaane, achiti anini Waaqa ka gaafa anini d'iba qabu na qarqaare fulla anini deeme ch'ufati na wahelche, fulla sorio iti qalani mid'aasaafi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani waaqoota baanani taanifi qube gurrale baafatani Yakobooti kennani, inni gadda guddo toko ta Shekemu d'aatu jirtu jalati awaale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobofi ilmaani isaa godaanaa kaani jennaani nami dira d'aatu suni keesa jiru ch'ufti sodaa reebu dad'abe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobofi worri isaa ch'ufti lafa Luzu, ta amma tana Betheli jed'ani, ta lafa Kanaani keesa jirtu, d'ufani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiti fulla sorio iti qalani mid'aase, fulla sunii Waaqa Betheli gula El-Betheli jed'e yaame, waan Waaqi achiti isati mullateefi, gaafa inni oboleesa isaa Esau duraa baqate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaaritini Debora jed'ani, ta duri Rebeka guddifte, doonaani gadda d'aatu Betheli ejitu jalati awaalani. Tanaafi Alon-Bakuthi maqa baasani, akasi jechaani Gadda Boha jechu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobooni Mesopotamia deebie jennaani Waaqi ammalle iti mullate eebiseefi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.32.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Uum 32.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan jed'eeni, Qara Yakobo siini jed'ani, ammo armaa achi Israeli siini jed'ani. Tanaafi inni maqa Israeli baaseefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.4+GEN.17.5+GEN.17.6+GEN.17.7+GEN.17.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Uum 17.4-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqi waan jed'eeni, Anini Waaqa Gudda; daraari, ilmaani heddu d'ali. Gochiti hedduuni siraa uumamte, hayyooti hedduuni si keesaa baati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini lafa Abrahamufi Isaaqoo kenne taani siifi ilmaani teetile kenna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba akasi jennaani Waaqi kae biraa deeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.18+GEN.28.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Uum 28.18-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobooni fulla Waaqi dubbateeni suni d'aqe akheekha old'aabe daad'ifi d'ad'aani muude ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fulla suni maqa Betheli baase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duisa Raheli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobofi worri isaa Betheli kaani, ato worri Efrathi ingahiinu, jii Raheli ala hobae, isii ilmeeni iti ejate, ammo ch'ininuuni turte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato ch'ininu ke jirtu, jaartini isii deesiftu waan jetteeni, Insodaatini, obsi, Raheli, ilmi d'ibileeni ya sii d'alate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo isiini laafte ta duaa taate, ato lubbuuni keesaa imbahiinu gurba maqa Benoni baafteefi ch'ichite; ammo abbaani maqa Benjamini baaseefi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanaani Raheliini doote d'aatu kara Efrathi, ka amma Bethlehemu jed'aniti, isi awaalani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobooni d'akha akheekha achi d'aabe, d'akhaani suni haga arrale awaala Raheli garsiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobooni ammalle godaane doofi Ederiti qajeele achi qubate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilmaani Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.49.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Uum 49.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato Israeliini lafa suni keesa jiru, Reubeniini niiti jaalto abba isaa ta Bilha jed'ani barate; duuba Israeliini waan kana d'agaye aka hama dallane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobooni ilmaani d'iira kud'ani lama qaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilmaani Lea Reubeni (ka angafa Yakobo), Simeoni, Lawi, Yuda, Isakari ammalle Zabuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilmaani Raheli Yusufufi Benjamini. ",
